The Mobile FR3 Duo robot description, SRDF, MoveIt and ros2_control files,
the odometry and /cmd_vel bridges, and the whole-body and navigation
Objectives are copied from PickNik's moveit_pro_franka_ws (packages
mobile_fr3_duo_mock and mobile_fr3_duo_sim) and adapted.

Third-party files:

- franka_description 2.9.0 (Mobile FR3 Duo: TMR v0.2 base, spine, head, FR3
  Duo mount v0.3, two FR3 v2 arms and Franka Hands)
  Copyright 2023 Franka Robotics GmbH
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its LICENSE file, which also
  contains a BSD license section, is copied to
  description/mujoco/LICENSE-franka_description; the copy adds a final newline
  and is otherwise unchanged.
  - description/mujoco/mobile_fr3_duo.xml is converted by PickNik Inc. from its
    kinematics, inertials and dynamics, and modified; it says so in a comment
    at its top.
  - description/mujoco/assets/tmrv0_2_visual.stl was converted by PickNik Inc.
    with pymeshlab from
    franka_description/meshes/robots/tmrv0_2/visual/tmrv0_2.dae.
  - The collision meshes link0.stl to link7.stl (FR3 v2), hand.stl,
    franka_head.stl, franka_spine.stl, fr3_duo_mount.stl, fr3_duo_cover.stl
    and tmrv0_2.stl are not part of this package: mobile_fr3_duo.xml loads
    them at run time from the vendored franka_description
    (src/external_dependencies/franka_config/franka_description/meshes)
    through package:// paths.

- MuJoCo Menagerie Franka FR3 model (franka_fr3)
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its LICENSE file, which also
  contains a BSD license section, is copied unchanged to
  description/mujoco/LICENSE.
  - The actuator settings in description/mujoco/mobile_fr3_duo.xml come from
    its fr3.xml.

- MuJoCo Menagerie Franka Emika Panda model (franka_emika_panda), for the
  Franka Hand
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; description/mujoco/LICENSE
  carries the same Apache License text.
  - finger_0.obj and finger_1.obj in description/mujoco/assets/ are copied
    unchanged.
  - The finger coupling (tendon and equality constraints) in
    description/mujoco/mobile_fr3_duo.xml comes from its hand.xml.
